<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="media/TCT_Star.png" >
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <link rel="stylesheet"  type="text/css" href="/main.css" />
        <title>TCT | Home</title>
    </head>
    <body id="index-body">

        <!--Main logo-->
        <header id="index-header">
            <img src="/media/TCT_Logo.png" alt="The Card Table Logo" width="400px">
        </header>

        <main>
            <!--About section-->
            <section aria-labelledby="about" class="page-section">
                <h1>Welcome to The Card Table!</h1>
                <p>
                    The Card Table is the ultimate hub for trading card game events. 
                    Whether you're an organiser hosting tournaments, trade nights, or casual game meetups — 
                    or a player looking to join exciting events in your area — we've got you covered.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Our platform makes it easy to create, discover, and book events for all your favourite 
                    trading card games like <i>Pokémon, Magic: The Gathering, Yu-Gi-Oh!</i>, and more. 
                    Join a passionate community and bring your deck to the table!
                </p>
            </section>


            <section id="index-card-container">
                <!--Organiser card-->
                <article class="index-card">
                    <header class="index-card-header">
                        <img src="media/TCT_Star.png" alt="Star" width="20">
                        <h2>Organiser Hub</h2>
                    </header>
                    <p>
                        Organisers, gather here! Click below to access your personal hub — 
                        a dedicated space where you can create and manage trading card events that bring the community together.
                    </p>
                    <a href="/organiser/login" class="link-button">I'm an Organiser</a>
                </article>

                <!--Attendee card-->
                <article class="index-card">
                    <header class="index-card-header">
                        <img src="media/TCT_Star.png" alt="Star" width="20">
                        <h2>Attendee Hub</h2>
                    </header>
                    <p>
                        Attendees, step right in! Follow the link below to discover and book exciting trading card events 
                        near you — from tournaments to trade meetups, there’s something for everyone.
                    </p>
                    <a href="/attendee/home" class="link-button">I'm an Attendee</a>
                </article>
            </section>
        </main>
    </body>
</html>